+---
+title: 'Story 2.4: Scope Enforcement & Cross-Team Overrides'
+type: 'feature'
+created: '2026-09-13'
+status: 'done'
+baseline_commit: 'f4c35b9e823dd64d4c85422144c5af8e5c6be9ee'
